00:01:22.210 --> 00:01:24.110
And my research specifically is focused

00:01:24.110 --> 00:01:26.580
on understanding how ants which have,

00:01:26.580 --> 00:01:29.050
I mean, most of you have
probably seen an ant before.

00:01:29.050 --> 00:01:31.970
They have very small heads
and very small brains

00:01:31.970 --> 00:01:34.010
to go inside those heads,

00:01:34.010 --> 00:01:35.110
but they're still capable

00:01:35.110 --> 00:01:37.710
