00:01:41.420 --> 00:01:43.430
And what my research has focused on

00:01:43.430 --> 00:01:45.830
is figuring out what brain
pathways are important

00:01:45.830 --> 00:01:49.060
for social behavior and
specifically communication

00:01:49.060 --> 00:01:51.660
between different ants to
coordinate their behavior.

