00:12:27.890 --> 00:12:29.640
And I think it's just been really cool

00:12:29.640 --> 00:12:33.330
to see how the scientific
community has really come together

00:12:33.330 --> 00:12:35.850
to try to understand SARS-CoV-2

00:12:35.850 --> 00:12:37.463
and how to potentially treat it.

00:12:38.800 --> 00:12:40.730
Also really cool about this paper,

00:12:40.730 --> 00:12:44.470
is that even though it's just come out,

00:12:44.470 --> 00:12:46.470
it's already been highlighted in the news.

00:12:46.470 --> 00:12:47.473
And so,

